  <content>
    <section>
      <para>The sum of the measures of the angles of a triangle is \( 180° \). The right triangle shown has angle measures \( a \), \( b \), and \( 90° \). Which equation could model this relationship?</para>
      <para>
        <figure>
          <media alt="A right triangle with angle measures a, b, and ninety degrees.">
            <image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/Algebra-1_01_04_04_01.png"/>
          </media>
        </figure>
      </para>
    </section>
  </content>
